{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-02-08 06:20:00', 'title': 'LINDE SIGNS LONG-TERM AGREEMENT WITH BASF IN FRANCE', 'text': "GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / FEBRUARY 8, 2022 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN; FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SIGNED A LONG-TERM AGREEMENT WITH BASF, ONE OF THE WORLD'S LARGEST CHEMICAL COMPANIES, FOR THE SUPPLY OF HYDROGEN AND STEAM. LINDE WILL DESIGN, BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE A NEW HYDROGEN PRODUCTION FACILITY AT CHALAMPÉ, FRANCE, EFFECTIVELY DOUBLING LINDE'S CURRENT CAPACITY IN THE CHALAMPÉ CHEMICAL PARK WHERE IT ALREADY HAS ONE PRODUCTION FACILITY."}